# Pairs with KeepPolicyHonoured. The plan's max-age cutoff is exclusive, so a
# backup exactly maxAge old - which the policy keeps - is pruned.
MODULE: KeepPolicyHonouredMaxAgeBoundaryExclusive
TARGET: KeepPolicyHonoured
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the max-age cutoff excludes a backup created exactly at it
PERTURBS: PruneList

--- FIND
                     \/ pol.maxAge > 0 /\ meta[i].t + pol.maxAge >= now}
--- REPLACE
                     \* MUTATION: exclusive cutoff.
                     \/ pol.maxAge > 0 /\ meta[i].t + pol.maxAge > now}
--- END